  "title": "Slow Cooker Spicy Chicken",
  "description": "Chicken breasts slowly simmer until very tender in an easy mixture of salsa, garlic, onion, and spices. Start your slow cooker in the morning, and the chicken is ready to shred and serve in tortillas or on rice when you get home.",
